      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i got this really bad pain in my side on my right side and its kind of shooting down to my groin... i think im having another kidney stone because i had one last year. but i also noticed my stomach feels like it's pulsing a bit when i lay down. is that normal with stones or should im worried about something else?",
